# Long-horizon follow-up defined before observing these continuous-run outcomes.
session_id: continuous_long_grid_short_hedge_20261009
status: EXPLORATORY_NOT_APPROVED
economic_thesis: "20 fixed anchored SP500/SPY buy limits stack $100 each. Only after actual long fills, use dynamic-beta-adjusted XYZ100/QQQ short maker orders as risk hedge, never a standalone short grid. Hold the linked basket until joint projected maker breakeven; do not reset at month/development/OOS boundaries."
mechanism: "Accumulate passive long inventory on adverse prices, reduce common market exposure with correlated short positions, and seek maker-only joint-basket breakeven exit; eligible maker activity, not standalone PnL, is the intended reward proxy."
falsifier: "Long inventory fails to close over extended history, funding overwhelms price path, passive hedge fails to fill, or $200 risk threshold stops strategy before sustainable volume."
portfolio:
  research_margin_usdc: 600.0
  leverage_limit: 10.0
  max_gross_notional_usdc: 6000.0
  long_levels: 20
